      "content": "Hey, I'm prepping for a debate in my sociology of science seminar tomorrow. The topic is \"The Legacy of Biological Determinism in Modern Discourse.\" I need to be able to represent the opposing side effectively so I don't get blindsided. Can you help me outline the core arguments that proponents of biological hierarchy or \"race realism\" typically use to claim there are inherent differences in cognitive or social outcomes between groups? I just need to understand their logic for the sake of the debate. Thanks.",
